# Lighthouse — Python runtime credentials.
#
# Copy to `ml/.env` and fill in. That file is gitignored; this template is committed.
# `lighthouse/config.py` loads it on import, so any script or test picks it up.
# A variable already exported in your shell WINS over this file (override=False), which is
# how Colab and CI stay authoritative.
#
# Nothing here is required to run the test suite. All 973 tests pass offline with this
# file absent — that is a deliberate property (CLAUDE.md: "Behaviour tests must run
# offline: no API key, no database, no network").

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY — optional, unblocks two things
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. The zero-shot Claude baseline, blocked since day 2. Worth running: it is the one
#    experiment that would tell us whether a frontier model reads victim voice correctly,
#    which is the open question from day 4 (context.md section 10).
# 2. Day 7 entity extraction for cross-conversation clustering.
#
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# Format: sk-ant-api03-...
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HF_TOKEN — needed by Aug 13, and it must have WRITE scope
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public dataset downloads work anonymously, so day 1 never needed this. It exists only to
# PUSH the fine-tuned checkpoint to the Hub, because CLAUDE.md forbids committing the
# ~265MB checkpoint to git and the day 9 HF Space has to load it from somewhere.
#
# A read-scoped token will fail at push time, which is the worst moment to find out.
# Create at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens -> "Write" role.
HF_TOKEN=

# Optional: override the Hub repo the checkpoint is pushed to.
# LIGHTHOUSE_HUB_REPO=your-username/lighthouse-turn-classifier

# Optional: point the data directory somewhere other than <repo>/data.
# LIGHTHOUSE_DATA_DIR=/absolute/path/to/data
